// Advancement dabloon economy, reviewed against BlazeandCave's Advancements Pack 1.21 Alpha Build 4.
// Unit: 1 dabloon is one small active-effort unit, roughly 2 minutes of intentional non-AFK survival gameplay for ordinary advancements.
// Large grinds/capstones are intentionally compressed; passive/stat progress is discounted; mob-head payouts assume heads are easy server drops.
